      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ELONDON SILLABUB\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nPut a pint and a half of port or white wine into a bowl, nutmeg grated and a good deal of sugar, then milk into it, near two quarts of milk frothed up. If the wine be not rather sharp it will require more for this quantity of milk, In Devonshire clouted cream is put on the top and pounded cinnamon and sugar.\u003Cbr\u003E"
